{"r":"xwy","lane":{"p":827,"e":[{"h":"خَوَتِ الدَّارُ","t":["(JK, S, Msb, K,) aor. ",[2,"تَخْوِى"],", (Msb,) inf. n. ",[2,"خَوَآءٌ"]," (S, Msb, TA) and ",[2,"خُوِىٌّ"],", (Msb,) ",[1,"The house became empty, vacant,"]," or ",[1,"un occupied:"]," (S:) in [some of the copies of] the S with teshdeed, [i. e. ",[2,"خَوَّت"],",] which is incorrect: (TA:) or ",[1,"became devoid,"]," or ",[1,"destitute, of its occu pants;"]," as also ",[2,"خَوِيَت"],", aor. ",[2,"تَخْوَى"],", inf. n. ",[2,"خَوَآءٌ"],": (Msb:) or ",[1,"its occupants perished:"]," (JK:) and ",[1,"it fell down:"]," (S:) or ",[1,"it became demolished:"]," and ",[2,"خَوَت"]," and ",[2,"خَوِيَت"],", inf. n. ",[2,"خَىٌّ"]," and ",[2,"خُوِىٌّ"]," and ",[2,"خَوَآءٌ"]," and ",[2,"خَوَايَةٌ"],", ",[1,"it became devoid,"]," or ",[1,"destitute, of its occupants,"]," (K, TA,) ",[1,"standing, without inhabitant."]," (TA.) And ",[2,"خَوَى المَكَانُ"],", aor. ",[2,"يَخْوِى"],", inf. n. ",[2,"خَىٌّ"],", ",[1,"The place became empty, vacant,"]," or ",[1,"unoccupied."]," (Mgh.) And ",[2,"خَوِىَ البَطْنُ"],", aor. ",[2,"يَخْوَى"],", inf. n. ",[2,"خَوًى"],", ",[1,"The belly became empty of food."]," (Mgh.) ― -b2- [Hence,] ",[2,"خَوِىَ"],", aor. ",[2,"يَخْوَى"],", inf. n. ",[2,"خَوًى"]," [and ",[2,"خَوَآءٌ"],"], ",[1,"He was,"]," or ",[1,"became, hungry;"]," (JK;) as also ↓ ",[2,"اخوى"],": (K:) or ",[1,"his belly became empty of food:"]," (Har p. 167:) or ",[2,"خَوَى"],", like ",[2,"رَمَى"],", [aor. ",[2,"يَخْوِى"],",] inf. n. ",[2,"خَوًى"]," and ",[2,"خَوَآءٌ"],", ",[1,"he was affected with un interrupted hunger."]," (K.) And ",[2,"خَوَتْ"],", said of a woman, ",[1,"She became empty in her belly on the occasion of childbirth;"]," as also ",[2,"خَوِيَتْ"],": (S, K:) in [some of] the copies of the K, ",[2,"خَوَّتْ"]," is here erroneously put for ",[2,"خَوِيَتْ"],". (TA.) And ",[1,"She abstained from food on the occasion of childbirth;"]," (JK, K;) as also ",[2,"خَوِيَتْ"],". (JK, TA.) ― -b3- ",[2,"خَوَتِ"],[2,"النُّجُومُ"],[1,"The stars inclined to setting:"]," (so in two copies of the S:) or so ↓ ",[2,"خَوَّت"],", inf. n. ",[2,"تَخْوِيَةٌ"],". (JK, Msb, and so in some copies of the S.) And the former, (JK, S, Msb, K,) aor. ",[2,"تَخْوِى"],", (JK, S,) inf. n. ",[2,"خَىٌّ"],", (JK, S, K,) ",[1,"The stars set;"]," as also ↓ ",[2,"اخوت"],": and ",[1,"the stars brought no rain:"]," (JK:) or ",[1,"the stars set aurorally and brought no rain;"]," (S, Msb, * K; *) as also ↓ ",[2,"اخوت"]," (A 'Obeyd, S, Msb, K) and ↓ ",[2,"خوّت"],". (K.) ― -b4- ",[2,"خَوَى الزَّنْدُ"],", (K,) inf. n. ",[2,"خَوًى"]," (TA) [or ",[2,"خَىٌّ"],"], ",[1,"The"],[2,"زند"]," [q. v.] ",[1,"failed to produce fire;"]," as also ↓ ",[2,"اخوى"],". (K.) -A2- ",[2,"خَوِىَ"],", aor. ",[2,"يَخْوَى"],", ",[1,"He called,"]," or ",[1,"cried, out."]," (JK.) -A3- ",[2,"خَوَى"],", (TA,) inf. n. ",[2,"خَىٌّ"],", (K, TA,) ",[1,"i. q."],[2,"قَصَدَ"]," [",[1,"He,"]," or ",[1,"it, pursued a right,"]," or ",[1,"direct, course;"]," &c.: if trans., it may mean ",[1,"he aimed at, intended,"]," or ",[1,"purposed,"]," a thing]. (K, * TA.) -A4- ",[2,"خَوَاهُ"],", inf. n. ",[2,"خَوًى"]," and ",[2,"خَوَايَهُ"],", ",[1,"He seized it; took it,"]," or ",[1,"carried it off, by force;"]," or ",[1,"snatched it away;"]," (K;) and so ↓ ",[2,"اختواهُ"],". (IAar, TA.)"],"f":"1"},{"h":"خوّت الإِبِلُ","t":["inf. n. ",[2,"تَخْوِيَةٌ"],", ",[1,"The camels became empty"]," (JK, M, Msb) ",[1,"and drawn up"]," (M) ",[1,"in their bellies."]," (JK, M, Msb.) ― -b2- See also 4. ― -b3- And ",[2,"خوّى"],", inf. n. as above, said of a camel, (JK, S, TA,) ",[1,"He lay down upon his breast, and then set firmly upon the ground his"]," [",[1,"callous protuberances called the"],"] ",[2,"ثَفِنَات"],": (JK:) or ",[1,"he made his belly to be separated by some interval from the ground, in lying upon his breast,"]," (S, TA, *) ",[1,"and set firmly"]," [",[1,"upon the ground"],"] ",[1,"his"],[2,"ثَفِنَات"],". (TA.) And in like manner, (S,) ",[2,"خوّى فِى سُجُودِهِ"],", (S, Mgh, Msb, K,) said of a man, (S, Mgh, Msb,) ",[1,"He raised his belly from the ground in his prostration:"]," (S, * Msb:) or ",[1,"he put,"]," or ",[1,"set, his upper arms apart,"]," or ",[1,"remote, from his sides therein:"]," (Mgh, Msb:) or ",[1,"he drew up his body, and made a space between his upper arms and his sides, in his prostration:"]," (K:) thus a man is directed to do in prostrating himself in prayer. (Mgh, TA.) ― -b4- Said of a man, it signifies also ",[1,"He lowered his eyes,"]," or ",[1,"looked towards the ground, desiring to be silent."]," (JK.) ― -b5- Said of a bird, ",[1,"It hung down its wings:"]," (S:) or ",[1,"it spread its wings,"]," (JK, TA,) ",[1,"and stretched out its legs,"]," (TA,) ",[1,"desiring to alight."]," (JK, TA.) ― -b6- ",[2,"خَوَّتِ النُّجُومُ"],": see 1, in two places. -A2- ",[2,"خَوَّيْتُهَا"],", inf. n. as above, ",[1,"I dug"]," (K, TA) ",[1,"for her,"]," namely, a woman, (TA,) ",[1,"a hole,"]," or ",[1,"hollow, in the ground, and kindled"]," [",[1,"fire"],"] ",[1,"in it, and then seated her in it,"]," or ",[1,"upon it,"]," (",[2,"فِيهَا"]," [i. e. ",[2,"فِى الحَفِيرَةِ"],"],) ",[1,"on account of a disease that she had."]," (K, TA.) One says of a woman for whom this is done, ",[2,"خُوِّيَتْ"],". (As, TA.) -A3- And ",[2,"خوّى لَهَا"],", (JK, Kr, S, K,) and ",[2,"خَوَّاهَا"],", (K,) inf. n. as above, ",[1,"He made for her"]," (namely, a woman,) ",[1,"the food called"],[2,"خَوِيَّة"],", (JK, Kr, S, K,) ",[1,"that she might eat it."]," (S.)"],"f":"2"},{"h":"أَخْوَىَ","t":["see 1, in four places. ― -b2- ",[2,"اخوى المَالُ"],[1,"The cattle,"]," or ",[1,"camels &c., attained the utmost degree of fatness;"]," as also ↓ ",[2,"خوّى"],", inf. n. ",[2,"تَخْوِيَةٌ"],". (Fr, K.) -A2- See also 8."],"f":"4"},{"h":"اختوى","t":[[1,"He abstained from food:"]," and it may mean ",[1,"he became void of everything but anger."]," (Ham p. 219.) ― -b2- ",[1,"He lost his reason,"]," or ",[1,"intellect."]," (K.) -A2- See also 1, last sentence. ― -b2- Also ",[1,"He took away"]," a thing. (JK.) ",[1,"He took altogether,"]," or ",[1,"entirely,"]," what another possessed; as also ↓ ",[2,"اخوى"],". (JK, K.) ― -b3- ",[1,"He"]," (a beast of prey) ",[1,"stole and ate"]," the young one of a cow. (IAar, K.) ― -b4- ",[1,"He cut off for himself"]," (",[2,"اِقْتَطَعَ"],") a land, or district; (IAar, K;) as also ",[2,"اختات"]," and ",[2,"تخوّت"],". (IAar, TA.) ― -b5- ",[1,"He thrust"]," at a horse ",[1,"in his"],[2,"خَوَآء"],"; i. e., ",[1,"the space between his fore legs and his hind legs."]," (JK, K.)"],"f":"8"},{"h":"خَوًى","t":[[1,"Emptiness of the belly;"]," (JK, K;) i. e. ",[1,"its emptiness of food;"]," as also ↓ ",[2,"خَوَآءٌ"],"; (K;) [both inf. ns.;] the former of higher authority than the latter. (TA.) And ",[1,"Hunger;"]," (JK, Msb;) as also ↓ ",[2,"خَوَآءٌ"],", (TA,) ",[1,"i. q."],[2,"خَوٌّ"],". (K, TA. [In the CK, ",[2,"والخُوُّ بالضَّمِّ العَسَلُ"]," is erroneously put for ",[2,"والخَوُّ وَبِالضَّمِّ العَسَلُ"],". The word ",[2,"خَوٌّ"]," belongs to art. ",[2,"خو"],", q. v.]) ― -b2- See also ",[2,"خَوَآءٌ"],". ― -b3- Also, [",[2,"الخَوِىٌّ"]," in the CK being a mistake for ",[2,"الخَوَى"],",] ",[1,"A low,"]," or ",[1,"depressed, tract between two moun tains:"]," and ",[1,"a soft tract of land:"]," (K, TA:) or ",[1,"a low,"]," or ",[1,"depressed, tract, in plain,"]," or ",[1,"soft,"]," and ",[1,"in rugged and hard, ground, sinking into the earth, larger than the"]," [",[1,"tract termed"],"] ",[2,"سُهْب"],", ",[1,"producing much herbage:"]," (AHn, TA:) or ",[1,"any wide valley in a soft,"]," or ",[1,"plain,"]," [",[1,"low ground such as is termed"],"] ",[2,"جَوّ"],"; (Az, TA;) as also ",[2,"خَوٌّ"],": (Az, TA in art. ",[2,"خو"],":) or ",[1,"a soft, far-extending, valley."]," (As, TA.) -A2- Also ",[1,"i. q."],[2,"ثَابِتٌ"]," [",[1,"Continuing, subsisting, lasting,"]," &c.]: (K:) of the dial. of Teiyi. (TA.) -A3- And ",[1,"A flow of blood from the nose;"]," or ",[1,"blood flowing from the nose."]," (K. [In this instance the word is correctly given in the CK.])"]},{"h":"خَوَاةٌ","t":["The ",[1,"space between the udder and the vulva"]," in the she-camel and other cattle; (K, * TA; [accord. to the CK and JK, ↓ ",[2,"خَوِيَّةٌ"],"; but this is app. a mistake;]) also with medd [i. e. ↓ ",[2,"خَوَايَةٌ"],", for ",[2,"خَوَاةٌ"]," is originally ",[2,"خَوَيَةٌ"],"]. (K.) -A2- Also ",[1,"A sound:"]," (A 'Obeyd, S, TA:) and the ",[1,"confused and continued sound"]," (",[2,"حَفِيف"],") ",[1,"of pouring"]," of rain: (IAar, TA:) and ↓ ",[2,"خَوَايَةٌ"]," signifies the ",[1,"confused and continued sound"]," (",[2,"حَفِيف"]," [in the CK, erroneously, ",[2,"خَفِيف"],",]) ",[1,"of the running"]," of horses: (K, TA:) and ",[1,"a sound like what one fancies."]," (Aboo-Málik, TA.)"]},{"h":"خَوَآءٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"خَوًى"],", in two places. ― -b2- Also ",[1,"An intervening space between two things."]," (JK, Mgh, * TA.) The ",[1,"space between the fore legs and the kind legs of"]," a horse; (JK, K;) as also ↓ ",[2,"خَوًى"],". (JK.) ",[1,"A vacant space between two things;"]," (K;) ",[1,"such between the heaven and the earth;"]," (TA;) like ",[2,"هَوَآءٌ"],". (K, TA.) ― -b3- ",[1,"A wide,"]," or ",[1,"spacious, open tract"]," of the earth, ",[1,"containing no herbage nor trees nor habitations."]," (TA.)"]},{"h":"خُوَآءٌ","t":["(like ",[2,"غُرَابٌ"]," [in measure], TA) ",[1,"Honey."]," (Ez-Zejjájee, K, TA. [By a mistake in the CK, mentioned above, voce ",[2,"خَوًى"],", the word thus explained is there made to be ",[2,"خُوٌّ"],".])"]},{"h":"خَوِىٌّ","t":["of the measure ",[2,"فَعِيلٌ"],", ",[1,"A low,"]," or ",[1,"de pressed, soft,"]," or ",[1,"plain, tract of land."]," (S, TA.)"]},{"h":"خَوَايَةٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"خَوَاةٌ"],", first sentence. ― -b2- Also The ",[1,"part that a horse closes with his tail, of the space between his hind legs."]," (TA.) ― -b3- The ",[1,"part"]," of a spear-head ",[1,"into which the shaft enters."]," (K, * TA.) ― -b4- And The ",[1,"wide part of the interior"]," of a ",[2,"رَحْل"]," [or camel's saddle]. (K, TA. [In the CK, ",[2,"من الرَّجُلِ"]," is erroneously put for ",[2,"من الرَّحْلِ"],".]) -A2- See also ",[2,"خَوَاةٌ"],", second sentence."]},{"h":"خَوِيَّةٌ","t":[[1,"Food prepared for a woman on the oc casion of childbirth."]," (S, K.) -A2- See also ",[2,"خَوَاةٌ"],"."]},{"h":"خَاوٍ","t":["[ part. n. of 1.] ",[2,"فَتِلْكَ بُيُوتُهُمْ خَاوِيَةً"],", in the Kur [xxvii. 53], means [",[1,"And those are their houses,"],"] ",[1,"empty;"]," or, as some say, ",[1,"fallen down:"]," like the phrase in the same [ii. 261 and xxii. 44], ",[2,"خَاوِيَةٌ عَلَى عُرُوشِهَا"],[1,"having fallen down upon its roofs:"]," (S:) or this means empty; its walls having fallen upon its roofs. (Bd in ii. 261. [See also ",[2,"عَرْشٌ"],".]) You say also ",[2,"أَرْضٌ خَاوِيَةٌ"],[1,"A land devoid of its inhabitants:"]," (K:) and some times it means, ",[1,"of rain."]," (TA.) ",[2,"كَأَنَّهُمْ أَعْجَازُ"],[2,"نَخْلٍ خَاوِيَةٍ"],", in the Kur [lxix. 7], means [",[1,"As though they were trunks of palm-trees"],"] ",[1,"torn up:"]," (TA:) or ",[1,"eaten within:"]," (Bd:) or ",[1,"fallen down and empty."]," (Jel.)"]},{"h":"خَاوِيَةٌ","t":["[fem. of ",[2,"خَاوٍ"],": and hence, as a subst.,] ",[1,"A calamity,"]," or ",[1,"misfortune."]," (Kr, TA.)"]},{"h":"خَاوِىٌّ","t":[": see ",[2,"خَائِىٌّ"],", in art. ",[2,"خوأ"],"."]},{"h":"مُخَوًّى","t":["The ",[1,"place of"]," a camel's ",[1,"lying down in the manner described above voce"],[2,"خَوَّى"],": [and so app. ",[2,"مُخَوَّاةٌ"],"; for] the pl. is ",[2,"مُخَوَّيَاتٌ"],". (JK.)"]}]},"maqayis":["الخاء والواو والياء أصل واحد يدل على الخلو والسقوط. يقال خوت الدار تخوي. وخوى النجم، إذا سقط ولم يكن عند سقوطه مطر; وأخوى أيضا. قال: وأخوت نجوم الأخذ إلا أنضة ... أنضة محل ليس قاطرها يثري وخوت النجوم تخوية، إذا مالت للمغيب. وخوت الإبل تخوية، إذا خمصت بطونها. وخويت المرأة خوى، إذا لم تأكل عند الولادة. ويقال خوى الرجل، إذا تجافى في سجوده، وكذا البعير إذا تجافى في بروكه. وهو قياس الباب ; لأنه إذا خوى في سجوده فقد أخلى ما بين عضده وجنبه. وخوت المرأة عند جلوسها على المجمر. وخوى الطائر، إذا أرسل جناحيه. فأما الخواة فالصوت. وقد قلنا إن أكثر ذلك لا ينقاس، وليس بأصل."],"mufradat":["أصل الخواء: الخلا، يقال خوى بطنه من الطعام يخوي خوى ، وخوى الجوز خوى تشبيها به، وخوت الدار تخوي خواء، وخوى النجم وأخوى: إذا لم يكن منه عند سقوطه مطر، تشبيها بذلك، وأخوى أبلغ من خوى، كما أن أسقى أبلغ من سقى. والتخوية: ترك ما بين الشيئين خاليا.","تم كتاب الخاء"]}